## Defect under test (current engine)
src/extract/gherkin.ts still derives description finding lines as:
  firstLine = feature|scenario.location.line + 1
  lineNumber = firstLine + descriptionIndex
and Rule / @example-space description refusals use keywordLine + 1.
@cucumber/gherkin elides blank lines and comments from description text, so
keyword+index under-reports the physical one-based source line.

